      "message": "General question about Primus. As far as I see there will be one dual-color LED on a side (left or right?) and one on the logo. What should be the expected behavior of that Logo LED?\n\nI\u0027m asking because the 2 LEDs on Brya are on the sides and they show the charging state together (orange\u003d\u003dcharging, white\u003d\u003dcharged). This is probably not what you expect from the Logo LED (TKP_A_LED_N) and the Power LED (LED4), so you might want to just toggle them ON/OFF during boot/shutdown and control them separately from the charging LED. \nAlso, those LEDs are controlled by `ectool led [right|left] \u003ccolor\u003e` now, you might want to change it in led.c depending on the actual location. \n",
